allow A reviewer decides the items of an access review campaign.
allow Each review item records the decision of one reviewer.
allow The reviewer's inbox lists the items still open.
allow The reviewer is never the author of the version.
allow (#101) review queue lists the aged holds.
allow The #101 review queue is read-only.
allow Findings: 3 per key at most.
allow Finding 2 of the verify output is the first orphan.
allow The docs/governance.md, rule 3 first.
allow A code review is required for this snapshot.
allow Rounds are counted per request; round 2 starts after the first reply.
allow Access review #90 lists the campaign's items.
allow Fixed 24h/168h unknown-hold review; built in, never a rule.
allow The aged unknown-hold review queue (#101), read-only.
allow needs_review is set on a price draft whose rates were guessed.
allow The line is flagged for review.
